# 10BASE-T Ethernet, IEEE 802.3i-1990, Clause 14: 10 Mbit/s, phase encoded (Manchester),
# as Wikipedia's Ethernet over twisted pair lists it, rev. 1356253892. The library sends it
# on the 40 MHz build. A frame here is one byte, idle low as the pair is.
shape manchester
bits 8
bit BR
BR 10 10 mbit/s
